{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/788496-books-missing-from-dtrpg","id":788496,"title":"Books missing from DTRPG?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-17T20:14:22-08:00","id":788496,"title":"Books missing from DTRPG?","content":"On the DriveThruRPG website for OPP there seem a few books missing. I'm looking at the list of books on the WhiteWolf Wiki and the ones not on the site are: Project Utopia, Reign of Evil.com, and Worldwide Phase I. Is there a particular reason they're not available in PDF?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10304-rester","name":"Rester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-17T21:59:03-08:00","id":788532,"title":"","content":"I can't say for sure, but there were a few books when OPP was doing a big push to try to get as much of the back catalog up to DTRPG that they didn't have good files for, leaving a some as either just scans of copies someone had, until the energy could go into redoing them properly. It's possible some of the books have had trouble along this process (it has been fairly slow going since they started for a number of reasons).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12